# io.grpc.NameResolverProvider file in this directory for the full explanation of why this
# is necessary: bnd's Private-Package embedding drops all but one embedded jar's copy of a
# same-named META-INF/services resource. grpc-core and grpc-util both declare
# io.grpc.LoadBalancerProvider; without this explicit merge the packaged bundle was missing
# grpc-core's pick_first provider (io.grpc.internal.PickFirstLoadBalancerProvider) --
# grpc's own default load-balancing policy when a channel has no service config, needed by
# every NodbStorageClient channel.
io.grpc.internal.PickFirstLoadBalancerProvider
